x fara.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['+ 3 to Number gives: ? '] ? (Lamba + 3), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['Adding 3 to Number gives: ? '] ? (Lamba ƙara: 3), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['Appending something to String gives: [this]'] [this]: (Rubutu ƙara-a-ƙarshe: ['something'])), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: Boolean rubutu, sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: Aiki rubutu, sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: ['Can I execute a code block without assigning code?'], sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (Aiki × 10), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (Aiki gaskiya: { ['Empty']. }), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (Abu an-gama), sabon-layi.
Fitarwa rubuta: (['This <path> has no file'] <path>: Fayil hanyar-fayil), sabon-layi.
